    "metadata": {
      "name": "EventGraph",
      "description": "A collectable: scores or heals whoever overlaps it, then removes itself.",
      "version": "1.0.0",
      "created_at": "2026-11-14T00:00:00Z",
      "modified_at": "2026-11-14T00:00:00Z"
    },
    "comments": [
      {
        "id": "comment-1",
        "text": "ADVANCED 8/9: A SMALL COMPLETE GAME - pickups, score, health\nThree classes cooperate only through events, never through references:\n  AdvPlayerStats (on the player): health, score, win and lose.\n  AdvPickup (on every coin/medkit): on overlap it SENDS `AdvPlayerStats.add_score` or `.heal`\n     to whoever touched it, then removes itself.\n  AdvHazard (spikes): on overlap it applies engine damage; AdvPlayerStats listens to the engine's Damage event.\nCompile order: a class that sends another class's event needs that class compiled first (the Send node\nreads the other class's compiled events), so Compile All builds AdvPlayerStats before AdvPickup.",
        "position": [
          0,
          -360
        ],
        "size": [
          1500,
          260
        ],
        "color": [
          0.9,
          0.75,
          0.2,
          0.28
        ],
        "contained_node_ids": []
      },
      {
        "id": "comment-2",
        "text": "1. COLLECT - `On BeginOverlap` fires on this object when something enters it; `other` is the toucher.\nDo Once makes a pickup collectable a single time even if two things overlap in the same frame.\n`kind` 0 is a coin: SEND `AdvPlayerStats.add_score` to `other`; any other kind is a medkit and sends\n`AdvPlayerStats.heal`. The Send node targets ONE entity; if `other` is not a player nothing\nhandles the event, so non-players walk over pickups harmlessly. Finally destroy this pickup.",
        "position": [
          -30,
          -130
        ],
        "size": [
          2360,
          600
        ],
        "color": [
          0.25,
          0.65,
          0.35,
          0.22
        ],
        "contained_node_ids": [
          "ov",
          "ov_once",
          "ov_kind",
          "ov_coin",
          "ov_if",
          "ov_pts",
          "ov_score",
          "ov_heal",
          "ov_self",
          "ov_kill"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "comment-3",
        "text": "2. TUNING - `kind` and `points` are variables, so ONE class makes coins, gems and medkits: place the class and override the variables on each instance in the level instead of copying the Blueprint.",
        "position": [
          220,
          70
        ],
        "size": [
          1180,
          430
        ],
        "color": [
          0.6,
          0.35,
          0.75,
          0.22
        ],
        "contained_node_ids": [
          "ov_kind",
          "ov_pts"
        ]
      }
    ],
